{"agent":"phview-lane","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":3,"detail":"The new `phase list --tasks` branch returns `_print_phase_tasks` before `_query(a, kind)` runs, so any generic list filters are silently dropped. `_print_phase_tasks` then calls `view_list(c.repo, \"task\", phase=a.tasks)` with only the phase argument. For example, `ddflow phase list --tasks P1 --state open --tag wave:2 --limit 5` still returns tasks from phase `P1` regardless of state, tag, query, owner, limit, offset, or `--all`, instead of applying those filters or rejecting the combination.","digest":"9591bdbd5519beeb","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/surfaces/commands/viewers_lists.py:cmd_list","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/surfaces/commands/viewers_lists.py:cmd_list"},{"chunk":4,"detail":"The `tasks` branch still bypasses the other documented list filters. Even if the added kind guard rejects calls such as `{\"kind\":\"phase\",\"tasks\":\"P1\"}`, a valid call like `{\"kind\":\"task\",\"tasks\":\"P1\",\"state\":\"open\",\"tag\":\"wave:2\"}` is routed through `view_read(repo, \"task\", phase=tasks, limit=..., offset=..., all=...)` without forwarding `state`, `tag`, `owner`, `query`, `since`, `item`, `match`, `mode`, `sources`, or `source`. The result is a silently over-broad response: completed tasks and tasks from other waves in phase `P1` are returned as if they satisfied the requested filters.","digest":"2af16c02dbe7dd91","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/surfaces/tools/operations.py:_list_read","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/surfaces/tools/operations.py:_list_read"},{"chunk":5,"detail":"When `tasks` is supplied, `_list_read` switches to `view_read(..., \"task\", phase=..., limit=..., offset=..., all=...)` and never forwards any other documented `ddflow_list` filters (`state`, `tag`, `owner`, `query`, `since`, `item`, `match`, `mode`, `sources`, `source`, or `phase`/`id`). For example, a tool call `{\"kind\":\"phase\",\"tasks\":\"P1\",\"state\":\"open\",\"tag\":\"wave:2\"}` returns all tasks in phase `P1`, including completed tasks and tasks with other wave tags, because those filters are dropped. The new kind guard only rejects `tasks` with a non-`phase` kind; it does not prevent silently ignoring filters, so conflicting filters should be forwarded or the call should be refused.","digest":"d7cd2d64d1d21d8b","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/surfaces/tools/operations.py:_list_read","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/surfaces/tools/operations.py:_list_read"}],"chunks_total":6,"coverage":"6/6 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":1,"diff_chars":20200,"diff_sha":"60689959304be16c0523bd4cf428810472dc94ebeb41e5980f4ebad6e21a77c4","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/PH-phase-view","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":285.9,"family":"alibaba","findings":3,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"644c8f77f9abd0c8","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/PH-phase-view.rubber_duck.[REDACTED:name].20261113T073318Z-c79f4d5f.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"reviewed_head":"6e7d13083209889b133c5d40fea9ccc35612ea31","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/viewers.py":"100644 9206573ee3b8d84731556d7b51daead422292d01","ddflow/services/viewers.py":"100644 815a53a7fdd5260a22d2d7f151a219ac14811638","ddflow/surfaces/commands/viewers_lists.py":"100644 278d987180fa6013bf60b7053bdfffa2591a6dd3","ddflow/surfaces/tools/families.py":"100644 565a0e38187b98858a1ccefee9b81cf508102a40","ddflow/surfaces/tools/operations.py":"100644 e6de9e91dcaa930107baf94a67fa0e1078f24a4f","tests/test_phase_view.py":"100644 fb2b0dd37450927c19ffec68a332efd6d750e825"},"reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","reviewer_digest":"3926c0df5644d7de","reviewer_families":["alibaba