{"agent":"phview-lane","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":6,"detail":"The test does not actually verify that `phase status <id>` selects the requested phase. It creates only phase `P1`, then asserts that some returned row has `id == \"P1\"` and the expected keys. If `cmd_phase_status` ignored the positional phase id and returned every phase (or `--all` behavior), the test would still pass because the only phase in the repository is `P1`. A concrete regression such as `phase status P1` returning all phases would not be caught; the test should create another phase (e.g. `P2`) and assert that the `P1` response excludes it.","digest":"1c3ca4bd2e8e582e","family":"alibaba","location":"tests/test_phase_view.py:test_phase_status_reads_one_phase","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"LOW","title":"tests/test_phase_view.py:test_phase_status_reads_one_phase"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":1,"diff_chars":21703,"diff_sha":"6b57e952d9864f20c50338a2a5147f5ac1d15765e9a154b6f38098bb26aea86d","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/PH-phase-view","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":0.9,"family":"alibaba","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":12000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"a15ce3299f03c3a1","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/PH-phase-view.rubber_duck.gemini-3.5-flash-lite.20261113T081455Z-66e80918.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_head":"ee723fa5be762893e12e2a173875511d071d27b8","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/viewers.py":"100644 9206573ee3b8d84731556d7b51daead422292d01","ddflow/services/viewers.py":"100644 d810f1c0e0ba7155fa2c746c3fff2b00ff6c9884","ddflow/surfaces/commands/viewers_lists.py":"100644 15bfdd566422da1546858fec2bf0e00e0248fc7c","ddflow/surfaces/tools/families.py":"100644 565a0e38187b98858a1ccefee9b81cf508102a40","ddflow/surfaces/to